  "door_reduction": {
    "before": 119,
    "after": 144,
    "why_not": "The baseline census includes the old renderer Run selection. The replacement routes local queues through the same Run. The additional protocol callbacks transfer the first response to that owner; none authorize or initiate a generation. Restart recovery asks two liveness doors before calling an in-flight POST unknown: the repository host that is submitting right now (in memory, lost with the process) and a Run lock held by another live process."
